# mtplx-music-swap-watch
owner: teknium · cadence: daily · status: SUGGESTED
**Want a loop that watches MTPLX memory use and tells you exactly when MiniMax Music 3 could be swapped in without OOM?**

## Prompt
Measure MTPLX RAM footprint; if under threshold, propose a clean swap to MiniMax Music 3 and execute; otherwise report how much headroom is missing.

## Evidence
> MTPLX is eating ~20GB of your 32GB. Music models need 13-15GB. We can't run both at once without OOM.
